<title>ESTONIA: Estonia's GDP rises 2.3 percent in H1 1996.</title>
<headline>Estonia's GDP rises 2.3 percent in H1 1996.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estonia's Gross Domestic Product (GDP) rose by 2.3 percent in the first six months of 1996 to 10.9 billion kroons in constant prices compared with the same 1995 period, the statistics department said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>				  Jan-June, 1996	  Jan-June, 1995</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct change)	+2.3			   +0.8</p>
<p> GDP (billion kroons)	     10.9			   10.6</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
